 "id": "zenodo:18318397",
 "title": "Input data and cached results for, \"MSA-based pLMs encode evolutionary distance but don't reliably exploit it\"",
 "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/18318397",
 "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18318397",
 "description": "<p><strong>Input Data</strong></p>\n<p>- response_regulator_inputs: Raw Pfam alignments (PF00072, PF00196, PF00486, PF04397) and PDB representative sequences for response<br>regulator analysis<br>- msa_difficulty: Pythia 2.0 MSA difficulty scores (msa_difficulty.csv)<br>- casp15_input: CASP15 MSAs and target PDB structures (msas/, targets/)</p>\n<p><strong>Intermediate Results</strong></p>\n<p>- response_regulators_seq_weights: MSA Pairformer sequence weights for response regulator queries (inference_results.pt)<br>- uniclust30_msas: Diversity-filtered MSAs from OpenProteinSet (1024 sequences each)<br>- uniclust30_trees: FastTree phylogenies for each MSA (.fasttree.newick, .fasttree.log)<br>- uniclust30_seq_weights: MSA Pairformer sequence weights for all UniClust30 MSAs (seq_weights.pt)<br>- uniclust30_iqtrees: IQ-TREE phylogenies for 10 smallest MSAs (.iqtree.newick, .iqtree.log)<br>- uniclust30_seq_weights_depth_200: Sequence weights for depth-200 filtered MSAs (seq_weights_depth_200.pt)<br>- contact_prediction: Beta-carbon contact predictions with/without sequence weighting (cb_contacts.pt, cb_contacts_uniform.pt, pdbs/)<br>- casp15_contact_prediction: Beta-carbon contact predictions for CASP15 targets (casp15_cb_contacts.pt,<br>casp15_cb_contacts_uniform.pt)<br>- layer_shuffling: Layer ablation study with shuffled sequence weights (single/, cumulative/)</p>\n<p><strong>Pub Info</strong></p>\n<p>- No need to manually download, the notebook pub will download necessary materials when executed</p>\n<p>- DOI: https://doi.org/10.57844/arcadia-ppdz-asaz</p>\n<p>- URL: https://arcadia-science.github.io/2025-phylogenetic-analysis-of-msa-pairformer</p>",
